  ],
  "steps": [
    "Add oats and optional chia seeds to a pot with a pinch of salt. Dry toast on medium heat 3 minutes.",
    "Add milk; simmer stirring 3\u20134 minutes until thick.",
    "In a bowl, mix yogurt, peanut butter and casein.",
    "Add cocoa powder to pot; stir until dark brown. Remove from heat; transfer to bowl.",
    "Top with fresh fruit or whipped cream."
  ],
